        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the Market – 3 Bedroom Semi-Detached Two-Storey Residence\r\n35 Shannon Valley, Ballaghaderreen, Co. Roscommon – F45 XF65\r\nGuide Price: €140,000\r\n\r\nThis 3-bedroom semi-detached two-storey residence comes to the market offering an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a well-located home with scope to modernise and add value.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated in the established Shannon Valley residential development, within walking distance of all amenities in Ballaghaderreen town, including schools, shops, and services.\r\n\r\nThe N5 Dublin–Westport routeway is just a 3-minute drive away, while Ireland West Airport Knock is approximately 20 minutes’ drive.\r\nWhile the property would benefit from modernisation, it offers a solid layout and strong potential in a highly convenient location.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises:\r\nEntrance hallway\r\nSitting room\r\nKitchen / dining area\r\nGuest WC\r\nThree bedrooms\r\nMain bathroom\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• 3-bedroom semi-detached two-storey residence\r\n\r\n• Excellent town location close to all amenities\r\n\r\n• 3 minutes to the N5 routeway (Dublin–Westport)\r\n\r\n• c.20 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n\r\n• Established residential development\r\n\r\n• Ideal starter home or investment property\r\n\r\n• Strong potential to modernise and add value\r\n\r\nViewing is recommended and strictly by appointment.\r\n\r\nFor Sale by Nigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: These particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They are not part of any contract. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided"
